From a527b1cdccc8ced4cb163aa2881365764bcf054f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yi Xie <imxieyi@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 6 Sep 2026 07:09:27 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 035/101] kosmickrisp: capture tessellation outputs on the GPU

Produce ordered TES records once, then pull raw capture and raster outputs without re-executing application effects. Preserve shared GPU capacity and query accounting, independent raster provoking values, and empty-patch draws.

Use one tessellator index winding for native and software consumers. Match indirect VS/TCS launches to the exact-thread Metal dispatch ABI.
